<br><br>
AMENDED<br>
REPORT OF INVESTIGATION
<br><br>
Underground Coal Mine
<br><br>

Fatal Roof Fall Accident<br>
December 15, 2005
<br><br>

Adkins Branch Mine No. 1A<br>
Arjay Mining, Inc.<br>
Panther, McDowell County, West Virginia<br>
ID No. 46-09106

<br><br>


Accident Investigators
<br><br>
James R Humphrey <br>
Coal Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
Sherman L. Slaughter<br>
Coal Mine Safety and Health Specialist
<br><br>
Jon Braenovich<br><br>
Mining Engineer<br>
Supervisory, Coal Mine Safety and Health Inspector, Roof Control
<br><br>
